# Uncensored.ai Downloaded Files
# Keep only metadata and manifests in version control
# Actual files are typically too large for git

# Ignore large downloaded files
*.pdf
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.gif
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.txt
*.dat

# Keep manifests and metadata
!uncensored_manifest.json
!fetch_results.json
!integration_report.md
!metadata/*.json

# Keep README
!README.md
